TFC Horizon — Horizon-native workshop mod (TerraFirmaCraft-inspired).

Inspired by TerraFirmaCraft (https://github.com/TerraFirmaCraft/TerraFirmaCraft);
not affiliated with TFC / TFG authors. Clean reimplementation for Horizon —
not a jar port or mechanical translation of Java sources.

Reference design target: TFC for Minecraft 1.20.1 (as used in TFG-Modern).

Original Rust, JSON, and generated placeholder textures in this folder: MIT
unless noted otherwise. Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed.
Do not redistribute TFC jar assets without a compatible license grant.
